# SPA fallback for BrowserRouter deep links (refresh on /flows/…, /messages/…).
# Rewrite to `/` — not `/index.html`. Wrangler/Cloudflare flag `/* → /index.html`
# as an infinite loop and silently drop the rule (code 10021).
# Keep /api/* first so Functions still receive API traffic.
/api/*  /api/:splat  200
/*      /            200
